msgstr "ANDG ! ANDG !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "He's fine. He's a good boss."
msgstr "Il est bien. C'est un bon patron."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "ANYWAY. Here we are! The land of the LIVING! Where we come to LAAAAAZZZZZZZZZEEE."
msgstr "BREF. Nous y voilà ! Le pays des VIVANTS ! Où l'on vient se LAAAAAAAAISSER ALLER."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Ironic. No?"
msgstr "Ironique. Non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Less so when you say it."
msgstr "Moins quand c'est toi qui le dis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A little."
msgstr "Un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Always thought that."
msgstr "J'ai toujours pensé ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well I think it is."
msgstr "Eh bien moi, je trouve que si."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I suppose living is in the eye of the liver."
msgstr "Je suppose que la vie est dans l'oeil de celui qui vit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "SAME!"
msgstr "PAREIL !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Lots of holidays at home here. Simmering around."
msgstr "Plein de fêtes à la maison, ici. Qui mijotent dans leur coin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "What's your favorite?"
msgstr "C'est laquelle, ta préférée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Valdiviantine's Day."
msgstr "La Saint-Valdivientin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blissmas."
msgstr "Blissmas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Balloween."
msgstr "Balloween."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You wouldn't have heard of it."
msgstr "Tu ne la connaîtrais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/c-11/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "When they bought their own holiday I thought it was silly."
msgstr "Quand ils ont acheté leur propre fête, j'ai trouvé ça idiot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/c-11/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But the traditional themed ice cream is DELISH!"
msgstr "Mais la glace thématique traditionnelle est DÉLICE !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "So many presents. So much bliss. So little organized religion."
msgstr "Tant de cadeaux. Tant de félicité. Si peu de religion organisée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That holiday has dropped in popularity but it always bounces back..."
msgstr "Cette fête a perdu en popularité mais elle revient toujours..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That's the best kind."
msgstr "C'est la meilleure sorte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I love the small ones. I mean, I love all of them, of course, but I adore the small ones. The ones you'd never know."
msgstr "J'adore les petites. Enfin, j'adore toutes les fêtes, bien sûr, mais j'adore les petites. Celles qu'on ne connaîtrait pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Cause you know for sure those people are there cause they want to be. Cause they care. And that's all it is, right?"
msgstr "Parce que tu sais que les gens qui sont là, ils sont là parce qu'ils le veulent. Parce qu'ils y tiennent. Et c'est tout ce que c'est, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "A holiday. A group of people, big or small, willing wonder into the world."
msgstr "Une fête. Un groupe de gens, grand ou petit, qui veulent faire naître la magie dans le monde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And what could be more wonderful?"
msgstr "Et quoi de plus magique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I'd put up with all the silly shifts in the world to be a part of that."
msgstr "Je supporterais tous les services idiots du monde pour en faire partie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like you do."
msgstr "On dirait bien que oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I still say"
msgstr "Je maintiens que"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/41/s/4/b/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Valentines"
msgstr "la Saint-Valdivientin"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/41/s/9/b/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blissmas"
msgstr "Blissmas"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/41/s/14/b/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Balloween"
msgstr "Balloween"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/41/s/16
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "is the best."
msgstr "est ce qu'il y a de mieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you do hate your job?"
msgstr "Donc tu détestes ton travail ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Hah!"
msgstr "Hah !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I love what it lets me be a part of."
msgstr "J'adore ce qu'il me permet d'être, ce dont il me permet de faire partie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/6
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Someone's getting sentimental."
msgstr "Ça devient sentimental, par ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/17/b/1
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Careful with this one, Holly."
msgstr "Méfie-toi de cette personne, Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/20
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Danteeeeeeeeeeeeee!</w>"
msgstr "<w>Danteeeeeeeeeeeeee !</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/31
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Flyer drop?"
msgstr "Distribution de tracts ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/39
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Flyer drop."
msgstr "Distribution de tracts."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/47
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "It might be the ash talking, but you really oughta take a break."
msgstr "C'est peut-être la cendre qui parle, mais tu devrais vraiment faire une pause."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/55 holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You know me."
msgstr "Tu me connais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/63
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "That I do."
msgstr "Et comment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/71
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "And you really oughta take a break."
msgstr "Et tu devrais vraiment faire une pause."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/79
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "When was the last time you did?"
msgstr "C'était quand, la dernière fois ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/87
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh. It was when it was."
msgstr "Oh. C'était quand c'était."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/95
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Can I leave these with you?"
msgstr "Je peux te les laisser ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/103
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "If you promise to take a day off."
msgstr "Si tu promets de prendre un jour de congé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/111
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I PROMISE."
msgstr "JE LE PROMETS."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/122
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "...thoroughly convinced."
msgstr "...profondément convaincu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/130
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Thanks Danteeeeeeee, you are my favourite fireplace."
msgstr "Merci Danteeeeeee, tu es ma cheminée préférée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/141
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "I'm your only fireplace."
msgstr "Je suis ta seule cheminée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/149
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "AND my favourite!"
msgstr "ET ma préférée !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/157
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "...get some rest."
msgstr "...repose-toi bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/165
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And REST we shall!"
msgstr "Et on va SE REPOSER !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/182
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Whooo-weeee."
msgstr "Ouiiiii-hou."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/190
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Thanks for today."
msgstr "Merci pour aujourd'hui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/198
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Truth be told, I'm a bit petered out."
msgstr "À vrai dire, je suis un peu à plat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/206
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I really appreciate your company."
msgstr "Mais j'apprécie vraiment ta compagnie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/214
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I've actually got another shift in a bit, but swing by soon and we can hang out again?"
msgstr "J'ai en fait un autre service dans pas longtemps, mais repasse bientôt et on pourra traîner ensemble de nouveau ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/222
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I've got a couple of flyer shifts lately, so I'm always happy for a walking buddy."
msgstr "J'ai eu quelques services de distribution de tracts ces derniers temps, alors je suis toujours ravie d'avoir quelqu'un avec qui marcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/230/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should you really be going to another shift?"
msgstr "Tu devrais vraiment aller à un autre service ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/231/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really are a workhorse."
msgstr "Tu es vraiment une bête de somme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/232/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't you promise Dante you'd get some rest?"
msgstr "Tu n'avais pas promis à Dante de te reposer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Why not? I've got the pep. Might as well use it."
msgstr "Pourquoi pas ? J'ai la pêche. Autant s'en servir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/c-19/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Neigh neigh."
msgstr "Hiii hiii."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/c-20/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And rest I shall!"
msgstr "Et je me reposerai !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-6/c-20/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Right after this shift."
msgstr "Juste après ce service."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly_office/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I really oughta start getting ready though. Swing by soon, sunshine!"
msgstr "Je devrais vraiment commencer à me préparer, cela dit. Repasse bientôt, rayon de soleil !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can already tell Holly isn't here because of the pointed silence, but it's still a bit jarring to look around and not see her anywhere."
msgstr "Le silence pesant vous indique déjà que Holly n'est pas là, mais il est quand même un peu déroutant de regarder autour de soi sans la voir nulle part."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Someone else seems to be here in her stead—she looks at you like she's been expecting you."
msgstr "Quelqu'un d'autre semble être là à sa place : elle vous regarde comme si elle vous attendait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/12/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Florence appears to be here in her stead—she looks at you like she's been expecting you."
msgstr "Florence semble être là à sa place : elle vous regarde comme si elle vous attendait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/21/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Huh. It's you. Back to take some more?"
msgstr "Tiens. C'est vous. Vous revenez en redemander ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/24/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well hey there. What brings you around?"
msgstr "Eh bien, bonjour. Qu'est-ce qui vous amène ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/27/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'm Florence, the floor. I work in Mayor Celia's office on the second floor landing."
msgstr "Je suis Florence, le sol. Je travaille dans le bureau de la Maire Celia, sur le palier de l'étage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/27/b/18
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You're Holly's friend?"
msgstr "Vous connaissez Holly ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is the one anointed in mistletoe around?"
msgstr "Celle qui est ointe de gui est dans les parages ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Here for Holly, actually."
msgstr "En fait, je viens voir Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's good to see you my love, but I'm actually here for Holly."
msgstr "Ça fait plaisir de te voir, mon amour, mais je suis en fait là pour Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's good to see you my friend, but I'm actually here for Holly."
msgstr "Ça fait plaisir de te voir, mon amie, mais je suis en fait là pour Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where's Holly?"
msgstr "Où est Holly ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Holly's not taking visitors."
msgstr "Holly ne reçoit pas de visites."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "That was rude. Sorry."
msgstr "C'était malpoli. Pardon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She's not well. She does this thing every couple of months where she refuses to take a day off until her body catches up with her and she just..."
msgstr "Elle ne va pas bien. Elle fait ça tous les deux ou trois mois : elle refuse de prendre un jour de congé jusqu'à ce que son corps la rattrape et qu'elle..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "...shuts down."
msgstr "...s'éteigne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do you think that is?"
msgstr "Tu crois que c'est à cause de quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr "C'est dommage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She's a busy bee."
msgstr "C'est une abeille affairée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "A silly busy bee."
msgstr "Une petite abeille tête en l'air."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'd say come see her, but she's asleep."
msgstr "Je vous dirais d'aller la voir, mais elle dort."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "It's kind of strange... She's so in love with the holidays, but she never gets to spend one with us unless it's like this."
msgstr "C'est assez étrange... Elle est tellement amoureuse des fêtes, mais elle ne passe jamais l'une d'elles avec nous, sauf dans ces cas-là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Never really feels like a holiday."
msgstr "Ça n'a jamais vraiment l'air d'une fête."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She'll be fine. So she says."
msgstr "Elle s'en remettra. À ce qu'elle dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Always is, poor thing."
msgstr "Elle s'en remet toujours, la pauvre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've tried to stop her?"
msgstr "Tu as essayé de l'arrêter ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't realise it was that bad."
msgstr "Je ne pensais pas que c'était à ce point."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I help?"
msgstr "Je peux aider ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Have you met her?"
msgstr "Vous l'avez déjà rencontrée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well she's hardly the first to let folks know."
msgstr "Eh bien, elle n'est pas la première à le faire savoir aux gens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-1/c-10/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Tell her to stop working so hard? I mean, good luck."
msgstr "Lui dire d'arrêter de travailler autant ? Enfin, bonne chance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No. What she needs is rest. Trust me, we've tried everything else."
msgstr "Non. Ce qu'il lui faut, c'est du repos. Croyez-moi, on a tout essayé d'autre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Almost everything!"
msgstr "Presque tout !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Everything worthwhile!"
msgstr "Tout ce qui valait le coup !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/27/b/1
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh. It's you..."
msgstr "Oh. C'est toi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/36
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "What she means is, we've tried everything easy."
msgstr "Ce qu'elle veut dire, c'est qu'on a tout essayé de facile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/44/b/1
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You'd know all about the easy track."
msgstr "Tu t'y connais en voie de la facilité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what haven't you tried?"
msgstr "Alors qu'est-ce que vous n'avez pas essayé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good to see you too."
msgstr "Moi aussi, ça me fait plaisir de te voir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And what's hard?"
msgstr "Et c'est quoi, le difficile ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-2/c-12/18
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I think what the human is trying to say is..."
msgstr "Je crois que ce que {{l'humain|l'humaine|l'humain·e}} essaie de dire, c'est..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "We haven't gotten her fired."
msgstr "On ne l'a pas fait virer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Yet."
msgstr "Pas encore."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Ever."
msgstr "Jamais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems a bit hectic for you, Kopi."
msgstr "Ça me paraît un peu frénétique pour toi, Kopi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems drastic."
msgstr "Ça me paraît radical."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Pourquoi pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We're not machines, even if Holly comes close. it's not exactly sustainable, or fiscal, to work oneself to the bone."
msgstr "On n'est pas des machines, même si Holly s'en rapproche. Ce n'est pas vraiment tenable, ni rentable, de s'user jusqu'à l'os."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "That's what I said."
msgstr "C'est ce que j'ai dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-15/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Drastic times."
msgstr "À temps désespérés,"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-15/23
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Drastic measures."
msgstr "mesures désespérées."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-16/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Because it would destroy her."
msgstr "Parce que ça la détruirait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-16/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "And us."
msgstr "Et nous aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-3/c-16/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr "Probablement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We care about her. It's just painful to see her like this over a job that doesn't even pay that well."
msgstr "On tient à elle. C'est juste douloureux de la voir dans cet état pour un boulot qui ne paie même pas bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It pays atrociously."
msgstr "C'est payé atrocement mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you've considered it?"
msgstr "Donc vous y avez pensé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And your solution is getting her fired?"
msgstr "Et votre solution, c'est de la faire virer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-17/7 holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-18/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No."
msgstr "Non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-17/15 holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-18/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-17/23 holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-18/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "Non..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-17/47 holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-18/47
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Pfff..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-4/c-17/55
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An awkward silence falls over your assembled group—no one can quite look you in the eye."
msgstr "Un silence gêné s'abat sur votre petit groupe : personne n'arrive vraiment à vous regarder dans les yeux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/5
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We have... maybe... possibly. Occasionally considered the thought."
msgstr "On a... peut-être... éventuellement. Songé à l'idée, de temps en temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/13
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Regularly."
msgstr "Régulièrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/21
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Increasingly so."
msgstr "De plus en plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "In jest."
msgstr "Pour rire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/53
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Mostly."
msgstr "Surtout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/61
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But we won't."
msgstr "Mais on ne le fera pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/69
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Probably not."
msgstr "Probablement pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/77
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr "Probablement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/85
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr "Certainement pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/93
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We'll figure something out."
msgstr "On trouvera autre chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/104
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A distant shout sends chills up your spine."
msgstr "Un cri lointain vous glace le sang."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/109
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I'm <w>AWAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKE.</w>"
msgstr "Je suis <w>RÉVEIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIILLÉE.</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/114
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Back to it!"
msgstr "Au boulot !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/125
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi and Betty scatter, leaving you and Florence alone to face Holly."
msgstr "Kopi et Betty se dispersent, laissant Florence et vous face à Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/136/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holly?"
msgstr "Holly ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-5/137/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh."
msgstr "Oh oh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/6
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "AWWWWWW. You came to seee <w>meeeeeeeeeee!</w>"
msgstr "AWWWWWW. Tu es {{venu|venue|venu·e}} me voiiiir <w>mooooooi !</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/14
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You're supposed to be resting, Holly!"
msgstr "Tu es censée te reposer, Holly !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/22
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE RESTING!"
msgstr "C'EST TOI QUI ES CENSÉE TE REPOSER !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/30
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Go to bed."
msgstr "Va au lit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/38
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You're NOT my MOTHER."
msgstr "Tu n'es PAS ma MÈRE."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/54
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Besides. I picked up a shift."
msgstr "Et puis. J'ai pris un service."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/73
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I'm <w>fiiiiiiiiiiine.</w>"
msgstr "Je vais <w>tout à fait biiiiiiiiiien.</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/81
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "And I'm out. Have fun."
msgstr "Et moi, je file. Amusez-vous bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/92
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly turns to you, her jaw dropping open to slur out an extended greeting. She doesn't quite seem her usual energetic self."
msgstr "Holly se tourne vers vous, la mâchoire grande ouverte pour articuler un long salut. Elle n'a pas tout à fait son énergie habituelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/100
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You <w>caaaaaaaaaaaaameeeeeeeeee.</w>"
msgstr "<w>Tu es {{vennnnnnnnnnnnnnu|vennnnnnnnnnnnnue|vennnnnnnnnnnnnu·e}}.</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/108/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you drunk?"
msgstr "Tu es bourrée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/109/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should you really be working?"
msgstr "Tu devrais vraiment travailler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/110/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I diiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiid."
msgstr "Eh ouiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-21/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "NOPE. No drunk. Only drink. No sleep. Only wake."
msgstr "NAN. Pas bourrée. Juste bue. Pas dormi. Juste debout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-22/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "No rest. Only work. No sleep. Only wake."
msgstr "Pas de repos. Que du travail. Pas de sommeil. Que du réveil."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-23/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Yaaaaaaaaaaay!"
msgstr "Yaaaaaaaaaaay !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-23/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How are you holding up?"
msgstr "Comment tu tiens le coup ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-23/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Florence said you were feeling a bit rough."
msgstr "Florence a dit que tu n'étais pas très en forme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-6/c-23/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well Florence is a filthy LIAR. A SCOUNDREL. COAL FOR BLISSMAS."
msgstr "Eh bien Florence est une sale MENTEUSE. Une CANAILLE. DU CHARBON POUR BLISSMAS."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I'm GREAT. Just had a powernap, picked up a shift, ready to RUUUMBLLLLLEEEEE!"
msgstr "Je suis en SUPER forme. Je viens de faire une sieste éclair, j'ai pris un service, je suis prête à FOOOONCEEEEEER !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "LET'S."
msgstr "ON."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/16 holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "JINGLE."
msgstr "FAIT."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "THOSE."
msgstr "TINTER."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/32
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>BEEEEEEELLLLLLLLLLLLLS.</w>"
msgstr "<w>CES CLOOOOOOOOOCHES.</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/40/b/1
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Florence is actually really lovely I didn't mean that at all, I'm just, I actually, I-I, I'm actually, just... heh... a little tired is all."
msgstr "Florence est vraiment adorable, je ne pensais pas du tout ce que j'ai dit, je suis juste, en fait, je, j-je, en fait, juste... hé... un peu fatiguée, c'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/40/b/9
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Only a little."
msgstr "Un peu seulement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/40/b/17
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But not too much."
msgstr "Mais pas trop."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/40/b/25
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You know?"
msgstr "Tu vois ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly4/0/g-7/43
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "AND ON THAT NOTE!"
msgstr "ET SUR CE POINT !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that the Gleester Bunny!?"
msgstr "C'est le Lapin de Gleester !?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "BRUCE!? BRUCE!?"
msgstr "BRUCE !? BRUCE !?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "WHERE IS THAT BIG BEAUTIFUL FLUFFY BASTARD!?"
msgstr "OÙ IL EST CE GROS BÂTARD DUVETEUX ET MAGNIFIQUE !?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>BRUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUCCCCCCCCCCCCEEEEEEE!</w>"
msgstr "<w>BRUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUCCCCCCCCCCCCEEEEEEE !</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Bruuuuuuuce?</w>"
msgstr "<w>Bruuuuuuuce ?</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Here bunny bunny bunny!</w>"
msgstr "<w>Ici lapin lapin lapin !</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/56
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>BRUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUCEEEEEE?</w>"
msgstr "<w>BRUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUCEEEEEE ?</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/61
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I brought milk!"
msgstr "J'ai apporté du lait !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/69
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And cookies!"
msgstr "Et des biscuits !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/77
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh. That's the other guy."
msgstr "Oh. C'est l'autre type."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/85
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "With the beard."
msgstr "Avec la barbe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/93
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "What's his name again?"
msgstr "Comment il s'appelle, déjà ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/109
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Florence says I'm grounded."
msgstr "Florence dit que je suis clouée au sol."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/117
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "She's not my mom."
msgstr "Elle n'est pas ma mère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/125
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Ground."
msgstr "Sol."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/133
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Dead."
msgstr "Morte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/c-1/141
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly collapses forward face-first, completely knocked out. A pair of arms catch her at the last minute stopping her from smashing her face on the floor."
msgstr "Holly s'effondre en avant, visage contre terre, complètement assommée. Une paire de bras la rattrape au dernier moment et l'empêche de s'écraser le visage sur le sol."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I've got her."
msgstr "Je la tiens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Betty eases Holly to the ground, gently lying her down before slipping away."
msgstr "Betty dépose doucement Holly par terre, l'allonge avec précaution, puis s'éclipse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/28
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I've got a <w>shiiiiiiiiifffffffffffffffft.</w>"
msgstr "Mais j'ai un <w>seeeeeeeerviiiiiiiiice.</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/39
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Just a dream..."
msgstr "Ce n'est qu'un rêve..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/50
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Merry Blissmas."
msgstr "Joyeux Blissmas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't realise she got that bad."
msgstr "Je ne pensais pas qu'elle pouvait aller aussi mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was kinda funny."
msgstr "C'était assez drôle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I warned you. Sometimes you've just got to see it for yourself."
msgstr "Je vous l'avais dit. Parfois, il faut le voir pour le croire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "The first couple of times. Maybe."
msgstr "Les deux ou trois premières fois. Peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Welcome to holiday Holly."
msgstr "Bienvenue dans la Holly des fêtes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it always that bad?"
msgstr "C'est toujours aussi grave ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She seems fine, maybe a little tired, but fine."
msgstr "Elle a l'air d'aller bien, peut-être un peu fatiguée, mais bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought she was drunk."
msgstr "Je croyais qu'elle était bourrée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Worse."
msgstr "Pire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You're only seeing the facade."
msgstr "Vous ne voyez que la façade."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Imagine that, plus drunk."
msgstr "Imaginez ça, plus bourrée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Full blown silly season."
msgstr "La période idiote dans toute sa splendeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "There it is."
msgstr "Voilà."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Poor Betty."
msgstr "Pauvre Betty."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "...don't worry. There's no fluids or anything."
msgstr "...ne vous inquiétez pas. Il n'y a pas de fluides ni rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Just a whoooole lotta tinsel."
msgstr "Juste plein plein plein de guirlandes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I should go and help."
msgstr "Je devrais aller l'aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't keep you."
msgstr "Je ne te retiens pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is she gonna be all right?"
msgstr "Elle va s'en sortir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/c-8/7/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Aw. I always love it when you do."
msgstr "Aww. J'adore toujours quand vous le faites."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/c-8/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Thank you for your help."
msgstr "Merci pour votre aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She's usually like this for a couple days."
msgstr "Elle reste généralement comme ça deux ou trois jours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'm sure she appreciates you swinging by, but what she really needs is rest."
msgstr "Je suis sûre qu'elle apprécie que vous passiez, mais ce dont elle a vraiment besoin, c'est de repos."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/HollyBruce/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "So... bye."
msgstr "Alors... au revoir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Florence is still here in Holly's place. She shakes her head when she sees you, confirming what you've already suspected."
msgstr "Florence est toujours là à la place de Holly. Elle secoue la tête en vous voyant, confirmant ce que vous soupçonniez déjà."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Was kinda hoping you wouldn't be back."
msgstr "J'espérais un peu que vous ne reviendriez pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/32/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, you're back."
msgstr "Oh, vous revoilà."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/35
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She's still out of it. She went really hard this time."
msgstr "Elle est toujours dans les vapes. Elle y est allée très fort cette fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll give her some space."
msgstr "Je vais lui laisser de l'espace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to help."
msgstr "Je veux aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "And me, hopefully."
msgstr "Et moi aussi, j'espère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/c-0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She'll appreciate it in the long run."
msgstr "Elle vous en saura gré à long terme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Whatever you're thinking of, we've already thought it."
msgstr "Quoi que tu aies en tête, on y a déjà pensé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/0/s/0 holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-1/0/s/0 holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll get her fired."
msgstr "Je vais la faire virer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hear me out."
msgstr "Écoutez-moi jusqu'au bout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But have you done it?"
msgstr "Mais vous l'avez fait ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Talk."
msgstr "Parlez."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/c-3/10 holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We're all ears."
msgstr "Nous sommes tout ouïe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "...well..."
msgstr "...eh bien..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-0/c-4/26
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Rude."
msgstr "Malpoli."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to take her on a date."
msgstr "Je vais l'emmener à un rendez-vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/holly5/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to make a new holiday!"
msgstr "Je vais créer une nouvelle fête !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your words stun the room into silence. It takes a few moments before anyone manages to actually say anything of substance."
msgstr "Vos paroles plongent la pièce dans le silence. Il faut quelques instants avant que quelqu'un parvienne à dire quoi que ce soit de sensé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/21
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "Oh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/29
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh ho ho."
msgstr "Oh ho ho."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/37
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "That'll end in tears."
msgstr "Ça finira en larmes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/45
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "There's a reason we haven't done it."
msgstr "Il y a une raison pour laquelle on ne l'a pas fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/53/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/74/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/77/s/0 holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/17/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-2/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought."
msgstr "Réflexion faite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I will."
msgstr "Alors je le ferai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you should."
msgstr "Mais vous devriez."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Ouais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/33
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "...so... how exactly is this gonna work?"
msgstr "...alors... comment ça va marcher, exactement ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/66
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You're serious?"
msgstr "Vous parlez sérieusement ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/75/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's for the best."
msgstr "C'est pour le mieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-0/76/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Deathly."
msgstr "Mortellement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They all exchange a few looks—you're struck by the feeling they've talked about this possibility many, many times."
msgstr "Ils échangent tous quelques regards : vous avez l'impression qu'ils ont déjà parlé de cette possibilité très, très souvent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You'll need cause."
msgstr "Il vous faudra un motif."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/13
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "She won't give you much."
msgstr "Elle ne vous en donnera pas beaucoup."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/21
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "She's frustratingly good at her job."
msgstr "Elle est insupportablement douée dans son travail."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But if she's cutting corners."
msgstr "Mais si elle prend des raccourcis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/37
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Which she'll have to be, bureaucracy and all."
msgstr "Ce qu'elle devra faire, avec la paperasse et tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/45
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "That should be enough."
msgstr "Ça devrait suffire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/53
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You'll need someone willing to tell on her."
msgstr "Il vous faudra quelqu'un prêt à la dénoncer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/61
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "It might go..."
msgstr "Ça pourrait se passer..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/69
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Poorly."
msgstr "Mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got someone in mind..."
msgstr "J'ai quelqu'un en tête..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfireddiscussion/0/g-1/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "Je vais voir ce que je peux faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollylovediscussion/0/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You can't just date everything. Besides, good luck finding the time."
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas sortir avec tout. Et puis, bonne chance pour trouver le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollylovediscussion/3/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Good luck finding the time."
msgstr "Bonne chance pour trouver le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's worked so far."
msgstr "Ça a marché jusqu'ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jealous?"
msgstr "Une pointe de jalousie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just tell her it's Valdiviantine's in July. June? What month is it?"
msgstr "Je lui dirai juste que la Saint-Valdivientin est en juillet. Juin ? On est quel mois ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Still... Holly's different."
msgstr "Quand même... Holly est différente."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Don't be ridiculous."
msgstr "Ne soyez pas ridicule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "She'll say she's got \"work.\""
msgstr "Elle dira qu'elle a du « travail »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She'll believe it though."
msgstr "Elle y croira pourtant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll just tell her they moved the dates because taxes."
msgstr "On lui dira juste qu'ils ont décalé les dates à cause des impôts."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I hate how much that might work."
msgstr "Je déteste que ça puisse autant marcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I could talk to some folks."
msgstr "Je pourrais parler à certains."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Kinda weird taking her on a date without asking."
msgstr "C'est un peu bizarre de l'emmener à un rendez-vous sans lui demander."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She's definitely... expressed interest."
msgstr "Elle a clairement... manifesté de l'intérêt."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That checks out."
msgstr "Ça concorde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "She just doesn't have the time."
msgstr "Elle n'a juste pas le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "So she says."
msgstr "À ce qu'elle dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great. Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "Super. Ça ressemble à un plan."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We'll let folks know to give you some space. Give you the house to yourselves, as much as possible."
msgstr "On dira aux gens de vous laisser de l'espace. De vous laisser la maison pour vous deux, autant que possible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollysublovediscussion/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But give her a night at least, poor thing's still off with the fairies."
msgstr "Mais laissez-lui au moins une nuit, la pauvre est encore dans la lune."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "That seems..."
msgstr "Ça paraît..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Counterintuitive."
msgstr "Contre-intuitif."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A holiday for Holly."
msgstr "Une fête pour Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Except the whole point will be to celebrate Holly."
msgstr "Sauf que tout l'intérêt sera de fêter Holly."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "And her job will be to enjoy it."
msgstr "Et son travail à elle sera d'en profiter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Precisely."
msgstr "Précisément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr "Quelque chose comme ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They all exchange looks—but they don't seem unconvinced."
msgstr "Ils échangent tous des regards, mais ils n'ont pas l'air peu convaincus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "It's roundabout."
msgstr "C'est tarabiscoté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/13
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But it could work."
msgstr "Mais ça pourrait marcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/21
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's the kind of roundabout that could."
msgstr "C'est le genre de détour qui pourrait marcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But we'll need folks to pitch in."
msgstr "Mais il nous faudra de l'aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-1/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It'll be all hands on deck."
msgstr "Il faudra que tout le monde s'y mette."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Otherwise she'll just take it all on herself."
msgstr "Sinon elle va tout prendre sur elle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We'll ask around."
msgstr "On va demander autour de nous."

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipdiscussion/0/g-2/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll leave it to you then."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Getting her fired seems like the safest bet."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna take her on a date."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna take her on that date."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna make a new holiday."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's make that holiday happen."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/c-3/13 holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Leave it to us. We'll clear the house for you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/c-3/21 holly_holidays/hollysecondthought/0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You come back when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/6
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Then you'll need to find a hater to help."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/14
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...I think Jerry would be the one most likely to raise a stink."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/22
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Why? Because of the smell?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/30
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Betty!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/38
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "If you don't do it..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_hate_quest_begin/46
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Don't worry. Operation Holly Day will be in full force."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/24
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Good. You're here."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/32
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You didn't try to get her fired!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We're still tying it all together."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/48
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "It's a bit ramshackle."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/56
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Holidays are Holly's thing, after all."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/64
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But we're doing our best."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/72
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Rebbie please don't pee in the lemonade."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/80
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "YOU'RE NOT MY DUCKING MOM."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/91
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Believe it or not."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/99
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "EVERYONE SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/129
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Yes Daddy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/137
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Shut. Up."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/156
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "And hide!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/164
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Everyone scrambles to different corners of the room, doing their best to hide before Holly arrives."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/181/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>I'm hiding!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w> GUYYYYS I'M HOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOMEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "It was such a weird shift. It was like NO ONE was home. Which is crazy, cause we're all pretty much always home, all the time, right? Like even BETTY was missing. That's WEIRD, right?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "OH HEY BOSS! Sorry I've been a bit awol. Strict R and R. Not my choice mind you!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Where is everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly looks around, puzzled, before cupping her hands to her mouth and shouting in every direction."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w> FLLORRENCEE? BETTY? KOOOOPPPPIIIIII?</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you forget?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so crazy! I wonder where everyone could be. It must be an important day."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "DID I FORGET A SHIFT!?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing like that."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh thank goodness."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Don't dooo <w>thaaaaaaaaaaaaat!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-1/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I don't THINK I did..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That's what I thought! But turns out it's just a regular old non-important day. That's what my calendar said."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you forgot to update your calendar?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Unless... it LIED!?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Honestly? Probably..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But then what's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just a little... SURPRISE!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "SURPRISE!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-1/10/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Happy Holly day."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your assembled guests—Holly's friends—jump out of their respective hiding places, all shouting in unison."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/20 holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "All"
msgid "<w>HAPPY HOLLY DAY!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/49
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "AHHHHHH!!!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/68
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I brought decorations!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/76
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I paid for them."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/84
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "The new ones."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/92
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "And I kept them hidden from you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/100
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I brought the pillows!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/108
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "I brought the heat."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/120
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I've got the coffee!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/128
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For once, Holly is rendered speechless."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/144
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Guys..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/152
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "This is so sweet..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/160
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh golly gosh. I think I might cry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/168
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Y'all can't just... make up holidays like this."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/176/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's all they are right? A group of us willing wonder into the world."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And what could be more wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Happy Holly day."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I have a confession..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I just picked up another shift."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But! But but but... I think I'm gonna cancel it."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that sounds smart."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holly...?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "So do I."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/c-8/21
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Or I just won't go."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I am! I am gonna cancel it!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "They'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And Holly Day seems like a much, much better gig."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Plus, the co-workers seem pretty neat."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're a handful."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, they certainly are."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I know <i>exactly</i> who you're talking about..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Which one... tell me?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's Lux, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it the pens? Because they fit in your hand?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "My lips are gift-wrap sealed!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-10/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You're giftin' exactly what I'm wrappin'!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-4/c-11/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I mean I'm quite fond of them!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I guess we best be started."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Let's..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "All"
msgid "THOSE."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/44
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "BELLS!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyfriendshipending/0/g-5/55
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Baby!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly's usual energy is completely absent—her eyes are rimmed with red, and her voice is hoarse. It seems like she's been crying."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You spoke to Jerry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I didn't."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/c-0/7 holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Jerry's a terrible liar. Which means he's very good at telling the truth if you know how to read him."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You're not very good at it either."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We were worried about you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/1/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was worried about you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought it would be funny."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But YOU did it."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And I was fine."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "It wasn't."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It wasn't just me."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You weren't healthy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But it was though. They might have thought it. But you did it."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Neither are you, apparently."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I got fired, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/14
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Merry Blissmas."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why did you get fired?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought I was helping..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love coal! And I hate you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I got fired for not doing my job."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I could understand it, if I actually fucked up."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-8/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I actually really liked that job."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-9/7 holly_holidays/holly_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well, you seemed nice."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And I guess I seemed stupid."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-9/31
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "And now... we don't have to see each other at all."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Merry Bleeping Blissmas."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-3/46
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I gotta say, the older I get, the more useful I think coal is."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyhateending/0/g-3/54
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Thinking of adding that to my stand-up routine, whaddaya think?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/24
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Project-Get-Holly-to-Take-a-Damn-Break is a go."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/32
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "She thinks it's just a standard rose drop shift."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We'll keep the house clear so it's just you two."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/48
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Treat her right."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Always."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure you're not a little jealous?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate this. I know she will too."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "We're doing it for her."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>FRIEEENNNNDDSSSSS.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-0/13
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Here we go!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Aww maannnn. I wanted to say goodbye before my <w>shiiiift.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "They're all being so sneaky lately."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "ANYWAY. HI. Sorry I've been so out of it lately. Crazy flu."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're working too hard."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad you're feeling better."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That's what SHE said."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Literally. It's all she's been saying lately."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/c-4/31
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I just hope she's not mad."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Same."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Sick ain't fun for anyone."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But now it's back to the grind, BABY."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Another Venetian's Day gig, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Not that I'm complaining, but I got all these darn roses to hand out. A whole lotta love for a whole lotta folks."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "HOLIDAY MAGIC BABY."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kitchen first, right?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shall we be off?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "DAAWWW. You remembered!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Aye aye. We're headed to where sausage gets made."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Kind of."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Holly make your way to the kitchen at a comfortable pace for once."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Abraca-Kitchen!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/35
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Koooooooopiiiiiii!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/43
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "SCRAM!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/74
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Kopi?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/82
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "No Kopi. Only silence."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/90/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Must be out."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-3/91/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe she's not in today?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But she's always in."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everyone needs a break sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "TO THE BEDROOOM."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Betty next, right?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-10/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-10/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Koooopiiii?</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-10/31
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Guess I'll just leave this one here."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-10/39
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Gosh, there really are a lot of roses."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-11/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "BEDDY BYEEES!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Yup yup! You learn quick!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take another casual stroll to the bedroom. Holly is right by your side, roses clutched in her arms."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>She's coming!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/c-13/10
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "<i>Operation Sleeping Beauty. GO. GO. GO.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/c-13/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>BETTY BOOPAH!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/c-13/38
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>HAVE YOU SEEN KOPI?</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/c-13/49
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Zzzzzz..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-5/c-13/60
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Betty is reclined on the bed, eyes shut tight and snoring comically. For a bed, she's not great at faking sleep."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Betty?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "ZZZZZZZZ..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-6/19
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Beeeeetttttttttyyy?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-6/27
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Z. Z. Z. Z. Z. Z. Z."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-6/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think she might be asleep..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Poor thing. Always taking on everyone else's weight."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is she now?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sound familiar, Holly?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-7/c-15/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "She is an angel."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-7/c-15/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Deserves a whole bouquet, she does."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Happy Venetian's Day, Betty!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Zzzzz..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/19
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Let's let her get some rest."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/27 holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/c-18/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Potty time!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Potty time!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-8/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Potty time..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/6
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Operation Runaway Rebel is a go."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/14
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "CRIIIINGGGEEE."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/22
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Zip it."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/30
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Yes Mummy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/44
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you enter the bathroom, Holly does her best to get her energy back up once again."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/52
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "REBBBBIIIIIIEEEEE!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/66
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But there is no Rebbie, only silence."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/82
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/90/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They've got a high stress job. Must be taking a day off."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/91/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know right? What a slacker."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/c-19/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I guess all that quacking must really get to them."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-9/c-20/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh. I don't mean that... they work very hard. It's a tough gig, you know? All that quacking..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "They'll never tell you, but they really love roses."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-10/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-10/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't we all."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Of course. But these ones aren't for me."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Anyway. A rose for Rebbie, and let's be on our way."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Do you remember what's next?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The office!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The living room!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/c-23/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well aren't you STUDIOUS!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-11/c-24/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Not yet SILLY! It's the other one!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "OFF TO THE OFFICE WE GO!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-12/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Off we go!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/9
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "And so I said \"WHO'S TERRY?\""
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/17
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "That's great Jerry but we really need you to be quiet."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/25
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "And she was all \"YOU KNOW? TERRY!\""
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/33
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Okay but..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/44
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "And I didn't really know but I kinda just went with it you know, like \"OH! TERRY! YEAH!\""
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/55
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "CODE RED. EAGLE IS APPROACHING. I REPEAT. EAGLE. IS. APPROACHING."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/69
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Jerry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/77
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "Wha-?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/88
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "<w>MMMH? MHHMHHMMMHHHH!?</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/105
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>Jeeeerrrrrrrrrrrryyyyyyyyyyy! Somebody loooooooovessss youuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/113
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The ruse has been holding up fairly well, but now that you've arrived at the office, Holly is beginning to look a little suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/129
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Ok now THIS one is just creepy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/137
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Jerry's always got something to say, or some knicknack to show off. Usually both."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/145/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lucky shift I guess."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-13/146/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everyone needs a day off every now and again."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Thankfully, Holly shakes it off with a shrug."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Maybe he's on a date!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Such a playboy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/24
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Good for him!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/32
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "One rose for Jerry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/40
msgctxt "Jerry"
msgid "<w>MMHMMM!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/45
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ohh, the sound of the living room crying out for attention!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Must be the love in the air."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/c-28/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "RACE YOU THERE!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/c-29/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "The holiday spirit works in mysterious ways."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-14/c-29/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "FINAL LAP! LIVING ROOOM <w>BAAYYBEEEEEEEEEE!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Here we go!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/9
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Thank you, Dante."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/17
msgctxt "Dante"
msgid "Anything for Holly."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly bursts into the living room far ahead of you, shouting out as she goes."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/43
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "<w>DantAAAAAAAAAAAAYYYYYYYYYYYYYEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/57
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/65
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "He's out."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/81
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "He loves roses too..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/89
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Darn."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/97
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "It's a little chilly without him around."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can borrow my jacket. If you want."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/106/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could hug... if you wanted. For warmth."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/107/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-31/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But then you'll be cold."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-31/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm warm blooded."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-31/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a little hot, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-31/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-32/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh. Yeah. For warmth."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-16/c-32/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That sounds nice."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-17/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly looks down at the mass of roses still left in her arms, shaking her head."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-17/11
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "All these roses. I'm worried we missed someone, but there's no one left on the list."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-17/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're for you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-18/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Funny!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-18/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a joke."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-19/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly stares at you, then down at the roses, the gears in her head turning."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-19/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "OH!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-19/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "From WHO!?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-19/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "From me."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-19/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-20/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Holly's jaw drops. It takes her a few moments to find the words."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-20/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "There's so many."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-20/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's barely enough."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "This wasn't a real shift, was it?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you upset?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/c-40/7 holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/c-41/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I think I might cry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/c-42/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-21/c-42/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I do think I might cry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-22/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's okay."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-22/c-43/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I suppose it is."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-22/c-43/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-22/c-43/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "This is so very sweet."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-23/c-44/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Oh, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-23/c-44/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not your fault."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-23/c-44/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you might need a break. But like, an actual break, not a bedridden recovery break."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-23/c-44/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well, when you put it like that."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/3
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I suppose I could be taking better care of myself."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you love what you do. Bringing joy and all that."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But sometimes all you need to do is be there. From what I've seen, that's more than enough."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Maybe it is."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You know, I finished work early this evening."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Strange to say, but I've got some time to kill."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-24/c-45/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Wanna meet me later? Help me \"jingle some bells?\""
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-25/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ho ho ho."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-25/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, just without the innuendo for me, please!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-25/c-46/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well come on then."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyloveending/0/g-25/c-47/27
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well of course! We'll jingle LITERAL BELLS!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Back in a second girls!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/8
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Maybe I wasn't clear enough."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/16
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I'm spending my newly found spare time with family and friends."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/24
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Family. Friends."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/32
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "See the problem?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah, and I'm neither of those."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait! Holly! I was wrong. I cared in the worst way, and I hurt you, and I'm sorry. (USE CHARM CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Well you were wrong, and it was awful."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "But I know you care."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You took the time to do it."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Once mistake shouldn't taint that too much."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/61
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You're sorry?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't say that."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Then I forgive you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/15
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I understand why you did it. But it hurt."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/23
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "At least you get that now."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/31
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Give me some time, but... we're friends."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/39
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Friends with a little more time for each other."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-0/47
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "That said. I've got plans tonight. Swing by soon?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnhate/0/c-1/69/c-1/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Then I can't forgive you."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Heyhey holiday. I'm on the clock, but if you wanna jingle about, I can always take a break?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's jingle some bells."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to say hey. Don't work too hard."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/10/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyreturnfriendship/0/9/s/0 holly_holidays/hollyreturnfriendship_redo/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm ready to Realize you, Holly..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Ho ho ho."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The bells jingle between you, and merriment was made."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/hollyreturnlove/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She is working too hard, but she is very happy."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_join/0/17/s/0 holly_holidays/holly_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I've got all the decorations."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_join/0/18/s/0 holly_holidays/holly_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_join/0/c-1/10 holly_holidays/holly_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Then, soon. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "You're back. Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Holy moly! Holly's getting out first? The world isn't ready..."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Let's jingle those bells!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a collection of holiday decorations, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Wow!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "It's like every holiday at once."
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Did you know...?"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "I've been banking all my holiday leave!"
msgstr ""

#: holly_holidays/holly_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Holly"
msgid "Now every day is Holly Day!"
msgstr ""

